  "title": "Lower debt, higher liquidity: The quiet transformation of household finances in Spain",
  "summary": "José Carlos Díez’s article, based on Banco de España’s Household Finance Survey, highlights the structural transformation of households’ financial position in Spain. Families are less indebted, less exposed to real estate, and gradually taking on more financial risk. However, these improvements coexist with long-term stagnation in living standards and ongoing challenges in employment and wages.",
